The Tao Te Ching is a manual that helps us peek through biology’s covers to reveal the deeper whats and whys of reality as best it can with words. Chapter 70 acknowledges the difficulty of this&#8230; My words are very easy to understand… yet no one in the world can understand. As ancient as it [&hellip;]
